Cell["\<\
MaxCyclotomicDegree bounds the exact field degree, not a numerical tolerance. \
The fourth-root field has degree two, so limit two succeeds and limit one \
fails:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a82914fc-981f-4724-9ed4-333579ba98c4"],

